    "finding": "Edited v6 normal exit reached UninstallTLSState markers through sigaltstack disable and stopped before after-munmap, while minimal no-signal exit reached after-munmap and after-uninstalltls. The altstack status was not-on-stack, exit_group and no-edit controls passed, and replacing only the host altstack allocator/free path made edited normal exit pass. The failed ownership assumption was freeing the FEX host signal altstack through FEXCore::Allocator during signal-heavy thread teardown. This is a bounded experimental inference; the remaining Go failure is not explained by it."
